        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Poem Themes</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background-color: #2c2c2c;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 20px;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .paper {\n    background-color: #fdfdfd;\n    background-image: linear-gradient(transparent 95%, #d3d3d3 95%);\n    background-size: 100% 40px;\n    line-height: 40px;\n    padding: 20px 40px;\n    font-family: 'Kaiti SC', 'STKaiti', 'KaiTi', serif;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #333;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 800px;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    position: relative;\n    transform: rotate(-1deg);\n  }\n  .entry {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .title {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    margin-right: 10px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .desc {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 15px;\n    right: 15px;\n    font-family: sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #fff;\n    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"paper\">\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《咏鹅》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对于鹅的喜爱赞美之情</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《江南》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了诗人对江南的深深热爱，也激发着读者对<br>那美丽风光的向往</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《画》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了诗人对画中美好事物的向往和对现实的忧伤</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《悯农》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对于农夫辛勤劳作的赞美之情，同时也表<br>达出作者对农夫的同情.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《古朗月行》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对儿童的天真烂漫，及他们丰富的想象力<br>的喜爱之情.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《风》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了诗人对大自然的敬畏之情</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《春晓》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了诗人对春天的热爱和怜惜之情，抒发了诗人<br>热爱春天、珍惜春光的思想感情.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《赠汪伦》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了李白对汪伦的深厚情谊.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《静夜思》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了诗人在寂静的月夜思念家乡的思想感情.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《寻隐者不遇》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对隐者生活的向往之情，体现了他追求宁<br>静和谐的生活和淡泊的心境.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《池上》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了诗人对诗中小主人公的天真幼稚、活泼淘气的<br>形象的喜爱，以及对田园生活的赞美之情.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《小池》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对大自然景物的喜爱之情</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《画鸡》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对优美高洁雄鸡的赞美与喜爱之情.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《梅花》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者坚持自我的信念，说明坚强高洁的人格<br>所具有的伟大魅力.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《小儿垂钓》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对孩童的喜爱之情，也表达了对于小孩<br>认真态度的敬佩之情.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《登鹳雀楼》</div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">表现出诗人不凡的胸襟和抱负，表达了诗人昂扬向上<br>的进取精神.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"watermark\">小红书号: 4130673107</div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
